OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening and overnight with
OL,7,Fvariable amounts of cloud, some clear
OL,8,Fspells. Cloud increasing overnight
OL,9,Fwith showers and heavy rain arriving
OL,10,Fthrough the early hours. Staying
OL,11,Frather mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,14,Fheavy and persistent rain,
OL,15,Fparticularly across the hills and
OL,16,Fmountains. Becoming drier and brighter
OL,17,Ffrom the west through the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
